'' tiko c2t: --verify of a header whose include has no translation yet is the user's next step, TKO0180, not the 'bug in tiko c2t' TKO0175 said (claude-docs RFC-0003 P0, F5).
'' TEST: cli
'' CLEAN: build/.c2t/untranslated
'' ARGS: c2t tests/c2t/src/untranslated/top.h --verify -o build/.c2t/untranslated/top.ti
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0180: --verify: tests/c2t/src/untranslated/top.h includes 'inc/ext.ti', which has no translation yet; translate inc/ext.h into that place first
